      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Haldric reaches the site where the fleet is due to return. Several ships have already docked. The orcs are on the frontier."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("Sir, some ships have landed... They look like they’ve been damaged by the voyage. Hmm, it seems that most of the ships are staying at sea."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("They’ve undoubtedly spotted the smoke from the orcish fires. We have to defeat these monsters before everybody starves at sea, or before Jevyan launches an attack with his fleet."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("Yes sir! The rest of the refugees have fled south, to our initial landing site. But if we fail here they’ll doubtless be slaughtered."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            text: _("Well, that settles it. Enough talking, time to fight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("For the glory of the men of the Green Isle!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-mad.webp",
            text: _("No, for the glory of all of the people of the west-north! Charge!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tan-Rinak",
            text: _("Bah! Puny human-worm, we will stomp you under our heels!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "General Heravan",
            text: _("—And raise your dead to serve us forever!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Familiar",
            type: "Familiar",
            side: 2,
            x: 27,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Familiar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Familiar",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
            type: "Jevyan Cloaked",
            side: 2,
            x: 24,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("Give up, boy! You can’t defeat me— Hmm, what’s this? You’ve learned to conceal the power of the Ruby of Fire. It makes little difference, your undead corpse will lay it at my feet."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-mad.webp",
            text: _("We’ll see about that. The Fool Prince of Southbay was wrong to start this war, but you’re the real monster. You’ve turned to using orcs as cheap lackeys and even sacrificed your own people to preserve your immortal unlife!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("I am hardly concerned with the doing of mortal worms — they are no more than petty pawns, orcs and humans both. The only difference is that orcs will not complain as long as they are well fed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tan-Halg",
            text: _("Actually, I <i>am</i> pretty hungry right now..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("Pah. Just eat the humans, then. But leave the boy’s body intact."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-mad.webp",
            text: _("Come and fight me yourself, you old bag of bones!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("As if a measly child would be worth the effort. Enough of this. A curse of darkness upon you, young prince."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Chocobone",
            side: 4,
            x: 0,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Chocobone",
